></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you've purchased your wares, sail around the world, or follow gossip to find ports that'll offer you the highest profits! Or, take a risk and attempt to smuggle items into ports where your wares are considered contraband...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/80bf6066c3d4aa4af2c2bfd193c8ee81.poster.avif?t=1774512912\" width=680 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/80bf6066c3d4aa4af2c2bfd193c8ee81.webm?t=1774512912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But more than this, players can even own the very means of production and invest in businesses to produce commodities for profit, or to feed their better industrial factories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/202a7338024c93037d8109dda6f3910b.poster.avif?t=1774512912\" width=680 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/202a7338024c93037d8109dda6f3910b.webm?t=1774512912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY ONLINE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends in private servers, both over LAN or the Internet - or join public servers with players all over the world in a large scale, constantly evolving game - where the full game is accessible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/77a720ae4cd00572f9f8de3ead83081d.poster.avif?t=1774512912\" width=680 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/77a720ae4cd00572f9f8de3ead83081d.webm?t=1774512912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD FILLED WITH ACTIVITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Seven Seas: Adventures, there will be limitless activities for you and your friends to do - hunt pirates and collect bounties, solve puzzles to find hidden treasure, and even visit the tavern to play a few games of Blackjack in the Tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/1dcb16f03a11305d854e679623088a0d.poster.avif?t=1774512912\" width=680 height=383 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/extras/1dcb16f03a11305d854e679623088a0d.webm?t=1774512912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to the Seven Seas: Adventures! Set sail and chart your course to fame, fortune, and adventure in this unique age of sail sandbox game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/header.jpg?t=1774512912", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2128430/23d0fe232e90a0822e3738650076081682a9d442/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774512912", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/